# Luxel library sprite — original art, Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# Three kelp fronds, 16 wide so `fit tile` lines a whole sea floor. Tall
# on purpose: rooted at the bottom of a 64-row panel they reach the middle; on
# 32 rows only their tips wave. Two frames of sway at 2 fps.
